{"id":"sh/g3ulwb69","kind":"textbox","position":{"left":48,"top":493,"width":553,"height":112},"text":"The historical processing audit includes six case re-renders. A separate code path reproduced source-file values, display mapping and provenance from the FITS inputs.","style":{"fontSize":22.51,"typeface":"Avenir Next","color":"#F5F6F5","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
