{"id":"sh/u1s3u1o3","kind":"textbox","position":{"left":671,"top":493,"width":561,"height":145},"text":"Gaia star checks screen 183 cutouts for substantial alignment errors. UNKNOWN lacks enough usable stars. PASS meets this screen, without establishing subpixel precision or a general error rate.","style":{"fontSize":22.51,"typeface":"Avenir Next","color":"#F5F6F5","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
